alAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="20" width="2492" height="45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle-0" value="공통 Request Controller와 Context Manager는 같은 위치 / T는 요청별 조회 / A는 사전 색인 생산과 검색 서비스" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="82" width="2492" height="29" /></mxCell><mxCell id="footer-0" value="VIA / Stage 4 / 구조 탐색, 미채택 대안 / 구현 및 측정 결과 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1396" width="2492" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title0-0" value="T  실제 reviewed target" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="72" y="187" width="2468" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title1-0" value="A  대안 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1336" y="187" width="1204" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-0" value="박스: Component, 서브시스템, 논리 실행체 또는 저장소 이름 / 번호 화살표: 동작과 순서 / 검정: 공통 / 파랑: 달라지는 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1324" width="2492" height="28" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-0" value="⑤ Context Manager가 현재 권한과 identity를 확인해 Context를 조립한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="498" y="1146" width="2042" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-1" value="별도 embedding helper, 색인 worker와 vector 저장소는 없다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="498" y="1175" width="2042" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-0" value="⑩ Context Manager가 검증된 원문으로 Context를 조립한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2022" y="1211" width="518" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-1" value="후보 1위도 대상 확정이나 실행 권한은 아니다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2022" y="1240" width="518" height="26" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
